# RenterMatch

Standalone two-sided lead marketplace. Not related to Royal Paw Spa or any other product.

## Product

- Demand: renters with thin/no/low credit, recent credit issues, weak rental history, or nontraditional income docs
- Supply: apartment communities willing to work with those applicants
- First market: Denver metro
- Monetization experiments: qualified lead, scheduled tour, lease placement (prefer placement when operators will pay)

## Hard constraints

- Do not promise approval or make tenant-screening decisions
- No credit pulls in the MVP intake
- Keep Fair Housing / equal opportunity disclaimers visible
- Treat licensing, FCRA, and privacy as open legal review items — do not invent compliance claims

## Stack

- Next.js App Router + TypeScript
- Leads: `POST /api/leads` → `data/leads.json` (gitignored)
- Local: `npm install && npm run dev` → http://localhost:3000
